cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Validation criteria that exclude their own mechanism: six failure modes of
  voxel damage operators applied to Ni-YSZ tomograms
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Arnav
    family-names: Mehta
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Mechanical Engineering, University of Wisconsin-Madison
repository-code: https://github.com/mehtaarnav/voxel-damage-operators-niysz
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registration documents and result tables for a study of voxel-scale
  damage operators applied to segmented Ni-YSZ solid oxide cell electrode
  tomograms. The tomography data itself is third-party and is not redistributed
  here; see the Zenodo record cited in the README.
